{"candidate_id": "cand-ap-altnews-0034", "factchecker": "altnews.in", "factcheck_article": "https://www.altnews.in/congress-and-tmc-leaders-are-sharing-an-old-video-depicting-violence-following-the-west-bengal-election-results/", "social_url": "https://twitter.com/MahuaMoitra/status/2052091475488547117", "media_url": "https://twitter.com/MahuaMoitra/status/2052091475488547117", "platform": "x", "media_type": "photo", "ground_truth_claim": null, "ground_truth_label": null, "claim_type": "provenance", "language": "en", "eligibility_status": "REJECTED", "rejection_reason": "Judged NOT the misinformation source (conf=1.00): [\"The post claims \u201cAche Din has arrived.\u2021 All Bengalis are free from TMC\u2019s \"gundagardi\", all women are now safe, Sanatani culture is prevailing.\" This claim does not assert the false assertion made by Congress leader Srinivas BV in his tweet about BJP\u2019s landslide victory. The post only expresses support for the mandate and uses a phrase that was used to describe an earlier period of Indian history.\u201d]\n\n[\"The fact-check article states: \u201cCongress leader Srinivas BV also shared the viral video, taking a swipe at the BJP\u2019s landslide victory by claiming that \u2018achhe din\u2019 had finally arrived in Bengal.\u2019\"]", "judge_confidence": null, "history": [{"status": "DISCOVERED", "at": "2026-09-07T13:08:46.077592+00:00", "note": "created"}, {"status": "SOCIAL_REFERENCE_FOUND", "at": "2026-09-07T13:08:46.078586+00:00", "note": "x ref via mass_source_allplatform.py"}, {"status": "MEDIA_RETRIEVABLE", "at": "2026-09-07T13:08:48.012278+00:00", "note": "uploader=MahuaMoitra caption=True video=False"}, {"status": "REJECTED", "at": "2026-09-07T13:09:12.109345+00:00", "note": "llama3.2: [\"The post claims \u201cAche Din has arrived.\u2021 All Bengalis are free from TMC\u2019s \"gundagardi\", all women are now safe, Sanatani culture is prevailing.\" This claim does not assert the false assertion made by Congress leader Srinivas BV in his tweet about BJP\u2019s landslide victory. The post only expresses support for the mandate and uses a phrase that was used to describe an earlier period of Indian history.\u201d]\n\n[\"The fact-check article states: \u201cCongress leader Srinivas BV also shared the viral video, taking a swipe at the BJP\u2019s landslide victory by claiming that \u2018achhe din\u2019 had finally arrived in Bengal.\u2019\"]"}]}
