u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964' This is exactly what the fact-check article claims to be a FALSE statement, which was made by BJP MP Nepal Singh. The post's caption does not provide any additional context or clarify that it's an old quote from 2018; instead, it presents this exact phrase as if it were current information being discussed."}]}
